key.name:
The forces of darkness... I am not sure. I have seen and heard all sorts of things
while adventuring, but I do not know exactly what you are talking about,
or whether I know anything related. Could you explain in more detail?

After clearing dungeons and filling 30 weekly reward counts,
if you obtain <font color="#ffd200">$item:20301427$</font>,
I will give you <font color="#ffd200">$item:11800119$</font>, a gift for Halloween heroes!

After clearing dungeons and filling 30 weekly reward counts,
if you obtain <font color="#ffd200">$item:20301427$</font>,
I will give you <font color="#ffd200">$item:11800119$</font>, a gift for Halloween heroes!

All this time, we gathered here and carried out missions together
for the investigation and collection of the world's anomaly, <font color="#ffd200">'Lapenshards'</font>,
and for research and development.
